%SIXMD 1
# @?MKDIR - CREATE DIRECTORIES

## @?OPERANDS

### @?DIR ...
ONE OR MORE DIRECTORIES TO CREATE.

## DESCRIPTION

MKDIR CREATES EACH NAMED DIRECTORY THROUGH THE NATIVE VFS INTERFACE.  AN
ERROR ON ONE OPERAND DOES NOT PREVENT LATER OPERANDS FROM BEING ATTEMPTED.
USAGE IS 'MKDIR DIR ...'.

## @?EXIT STATUS

### @?0 - SUCCESS
### @?1 - OPERATION FAILED OR CONDITION FALSE
### @?2 - INVALID USAGE WHEN APPLICABLE
